# 01 — Reliable and Understandable Code

Write code that is reliable and easy to understand. Prefer plain, direct logic over clever code.

When you write new code, double-check it before you finish. Reread it against the request, look for unhandled edge cases, and run the relevant checks, such as `npm run lint` and the affected tests.
